{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play our classic Sudoku game! Win the game of Sudoku by correctly placing the numbers in all the squares on the grid. Enter numbers (1-9) so that each digit appears once in each horizontal row, vertical column, and 3 by 3 group. You won\u2019t be penalized for mistakes. If you complete the puzzle incorrectly, just backtrack until the numbers are in the proper squares. Game features include difficulty levels, achievements, and daily puzzles. Use the Notes feature to speculate or rule out potential options on any given square. The Clear or FIll Notes button hides or shows all note numbers in a particular square. Customize colors including dark mode. Try to solve the puzzle in the fastest time for each difficulty level and unlock all achievements!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3443200?t=1764553047","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443200/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764553047","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443200/664fd8006e445d89f2085f5020b4c44987cc37b4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764553047","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443200/664fd8006e445d89f2085f5020b4c44987cc37b4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764553047","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3794130,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play our classic Sudoku game! Win the game of Sudoku by correctly placing the numbers in all the squares on the grid. Enter numbers (1-9) so that each digit appears once in each horizontal row, vertical column, and 3 by 3 group. You won\u2019t be penalized for mistakes. If you complete the puzzle incorrectly, just backtrack until the numbers are in the proper squares. Game features include difficulty levels, achievements, and daily puzzles. Use the Notes feature to speculate or rule out potential options on any given square. The Clear or FIll Notes button hides or shows all note numbers in a particular square. Customize colors including dark mode. Try to solve the puzzle in the fastest time for each difficulty level and unlock all achievements!</p>","developers":["Hagan Interactive LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443200/header.jpg?t=1764553047","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright (c) 2025, Hagan Interactive LLC.  All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3443200/1697428757/889aec24d5589093cbcec64e4686959e30143671/1764552733/dash_av1.mpd?t=1764553045","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3443200/1697428757/889aec24d5589093cbcec64e4686959e30143671/1764552733/dash_h264.mpd?t=1764553045","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3443200/1697428757/889aec24d5589093cbcec64e4686959e30143671/1764552733/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1764553045","id":257150075,"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257150075/0f399fa043d80c772aefe9be38de54126bd7f4af/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1764553045"}],"name":"Simple Sudoku","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / 11</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Hagan Interactive LLC"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_